    "body": "I don't think so, unless there's some kind of \"combining\" whitespace that works differently when in the same text node as opposed to split, or someone being cute with lone surrogates?\r\n\r\nIn any case, the important bit here is that there's no doubt that it's all remaining nodes, not just all following nodes. I don't think it's ambiguous, just asking to make sure this was deliberate.",
